+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/i2c/i2c.txt
@@ -137,6 +137,12 @@ wants to support one of the below features, it should adapt these bindings.
 - wakeup-source
 	device can be used as a wakeup source.
 
+- bus-timeout-ms
